:: Spa Beauty Gate
<<endevent>><<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>
<<set _hbscLevel to ($hbsc and $hbsc.account ? $hbsc.account.level : 0)>>
<<set _hbscTier to _hbscLevel >= 5 ? "black" : _hbscLevel >= 4 ? "platinum" : _hbscLevel >= 3 ? "gold" : _hbscLevel >= 2 ? "silver" : _hbscLevel >= 1 ? "basic" : "no">>
"Private beauty care is for members only." The receptionist smiles for a moment, then the smile fades. "The public facilities are enough for walk-ins."
<br><br>
Beyond the desk, the private corridor smells faintly of warm stone, expensive oils, and cut flowers. A uniformed guard watches from beside a frosted glass door.
<br><br>
<<link [[Push through anyway|Spa Beauty Push Through]]>><<crimeUp 80 "trespassing">><</link>><<crime "trespassing">>
<br><br>
<<if _hbscLevel >= 4>>
	<<icon "access-card.png">><<link [[Show your HBSC priority card|Spa Beauty Bank Card]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif _hbscLevel is 3>>
	<<icon "access-card.png">><<link [[Show your gold HBSC card|Spa Beauty Gold Card]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif _hbscLevel >= 1>>
	<<icon "access-card.png">><<link [[Show your HBSC card|Spa Beauty Low Card]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave it|Spa]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Gold Card
<<effects>>
The receptionist takes one look at your card, then another at your face. "Gold is respectable. Very respectable. But our private suites are for clients with a higher level of access."
<br><br>
The apology sounds practised. The glance after it is honest. You understand well enough. You are close, but still not part of their world.
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Spa]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Low Card
<<effects>>
The receptionist looks at the card without touching it. "That is not the kind of account our members usually hold. The public services are still open to you."
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Spa]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Bank Card
<<effects>>
<<set _hbscLevel to ($hbsc and $hbsc.account ? $hbsc.account.level : 0)>>
<<set _hbscTier to _hbscLevel >= 5 ? "black" : "platinum">>
You slide your HBSC card onto the desk.
<br><br>
The receptionist glances down, ready to refuse you. Then <<his>> expression freezes. <<He>> coughs into <<his>> fist, straightens <<his>> posture, and returns the card with both hands.
<br><br>
"Of course," <<he>> says, now careful enough to sound almost frightened. "I had not realised you were a <<print _hbscTier>> client. We would be honoured to register you as a private member, if you want it."
<br><br>
<div class="hbsc-brochure">
	<span class="gold">Private spa membership</span><br>
	• Opening fee: <<printprice 7500000>><br>
	• Access: Private beauty care, members' parties, and personal masseur bookings
</div>
<br>
<<if $spaBeautyMember is 1>>
	"You are already on our private list," <<he>> adds quickly.
	<br><br>
	<<spaicon "massage">><<link [[Review private services|Spa Beauty Menu]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $money >= (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(7500000) : 7500000)>>
	<<link [[Register as a private member|Spa Beauty Register]]>><<money -7500000 "spa">><<set $spaBeautyMember to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">You cannot afford the opening fee.</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Spa]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Register
<<effects>>
The receptionist takes a slim folder, a fountain pen, and a card stamped with the spa's crest. <<He>> does not mention the money again once the payment goes through.
<br><br>
"Welcome," <<he>> says. "Your name will be recognised at the private desk. Please let us know whether you would like a treatment, a social booking, or a personal masseur."
<br><br>
<span class="green"><i>You are now a private spa member.</i></span>
<br>
<<spaicon "massage">><<link [[View private beauty care|Spa Beauty Menu]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Return to the foyer|Spa]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

