:: Spa Beauty Pearl Arrive
<<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>
An attendant in white linen greets you at the entrance to the private wing. <<He>> checks your name against a leather-bound ledger, then leads you down a corridor that smells of warm stone and crushed herbs. The floor changes from tile to heated slate beneath your bare feet.
<br><br>
The treatment room is small and dim. Candles line a shelf above a stone basin. A narrow table covered in fresh linen sits in the centre. Beside it, a wooden tray holds a shallow ceramic bowl filled with pale pearl scrub that catches the light. A second bowl contains warm oil.
<br><br>
"Please undress and lie face down when you are ready," the attendant says, setting out a folded towel. "I will return in a moment." 
<br><br>
<<He>> draws a curtain across the doorway and leaves you to the quiet.
<br><br>
<<link [[Lie down on the table|Spa Beauty Pearl Treatment]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Pearl Treatment
<<effects>>
<<upperstrip>><<lowerstrip>><<legsstrip>><<feetstrip>><<handsstrip>><<handheldstrip>><<neckstrip>><<headstrip>>
The <<person>> returns, rolls <<his>> sleeves to the elbow, and begins. <<He>> scoops up a mixture of pearl powder, milk, crushed rice, and something grainy that smells faintly of honey. <<He>> works it into your shoulders with the heels of <<his>> palms.
<br><br>
The scrub is rough at first, almost uncomfortable, but the pressure soon settles into a steady rhythm. <<He>> moves down your spine, across your lower back, and over each arm from shoulder to wrist. The milk softens the grit as <<he>> works, and you can feel old dry skin lifting away.
<br><br>
When <<he>> reaches your legs, <<he>> switches to the warmed oil. <<His>> thumbs find knots you didn't know you had; behind your knees, along the arches of your feet, in the tight bands of muscle above your ankles. Each one releases with a dull ache that dissolves into warmth.
<br><br>
<<He>> asks you to turn over. The ceiling is a blur of candlelight. <<He>> works the pearl scrub across your collarbones, your chest, the soft skin of your stomach. You feel the tension draining out of you.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Spa Beauty Pearl Finish]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Pearl Finish
<<effects>>
<<run V.beautyBoost = V.beautyBoost || {}; V.beautyBoost.spa = { amount: 3000, expires: Time.days + 7, treatment: "pearl body polish" }; delete V.beautyBoost._spaShown>>
The <<person>> wipes the last of the scrub away with a warm, damp cloth, then pats your skin dry with a towel. <<He>> holds up a hand mirror.
<br><br>
Your skin looks different, as if someone has gently cleaned away a layer of neglect you had not noticed. Your complexion is smoother. The light catches it differently.
<br><br>
"The effects will last about a week," <<he>> says, folding the towel. "You will notice it most in the first few days. After that, it fades gradually."
<br><br>
You dress slowly. Your limbs feel heavy with relaxation, and even the walk back to the foyer seems easier than before.<<lstress>><<ltiredness>><<stress -8>><<tiredness -6>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Return to the foyer|Spa]]>><<pass 45>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Caviar Arrive
<<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>
A <<person>> in a charcoal suit meets you in the private corridor. <<He>> does not introduce <<himself>>; <<he>> simply knows your name. <<He>> leads you past the standard treatment rooms to a door at the far end, marked with nothing but a small brass number.
<br><br>
Inside, the suite is larger than you expected. The walls are dark stone, and the lighting is warm and soft. A padded treatment table sits in the centre, with two trolleys beside it covered in bottles, vials, and tools you do not recognise. Soft music fills the space.
<br><br>
"The immersion takes about three hours," the suited <<person>> says. "We begin with a full-body cleanse, then the caviar application, and finish with gold-leaf recovery. You may undress behind the screen."
<br><br>
<<He>> draws a folding screen of dark wood and cream fabric across one corner of the room, then steps out to give you privacy.
<br><br>
<<link [[Undress and begin|Spa Beauty Caviar Treatment]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Caviar Treatment
<<effects>>
<<upperstrip>><<lowerstrip>><<legsstrip>><<feetstrip>><<handsstrip>><<handheldstrip>><<neckstrip>><<headstrip>>
The treatment begins with a cleanse more thorough than any bath you have taken. Two attendants work in silence, one on your upper body and one on your lower body, using cloths soaked in something warm and faintly citrus-scented. Every inch of your skin is wiped, patted, and dried before the next stage begins.
<br><br>
The caviar extract is cold. It arrives in a shallow porcelain dish and has a sharp mineral smell. The suited <<person>> spreads it across your face first, then your neck and shoulders, in slow, careful strokes. It tightens slightly as it dries.
<br><br>
While the mask works, another attendant wraps your hands and feet in heated towels, then massages chilled metal rollers along the backs of your calves. The contrast between warm hands and feet and cold muscles is strange at first, then deeply relaxing.
<br><br>
Time blurs. 
<br><br>
They peel the caviar mask away in a single sheet, revealing skin that feels almost too smooth, as if the top layer has been gently softened away. The gold leaf comes next: thin squares pressed along your jawline, across your forehead, and down the bridge of your nose. The suited <<person>> smooths each piece flat with a soft brush.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Spa Beauty Caviar Finish]]>><<pass 100>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Caviar Finish
<<effects>>
<<run V.beautyBoost = V.beautyBoost || {}; V.beautyBoost.spa = { amount: 5000, expires: Time.days + 30, treatment: "white caviar and 24-carat gold immersion" }; delete V.beautyBoost._spaShown>>
The final hour is recovery. You lie still beneath a thin sheet while the gold leaf settles against your skin. The suited <<person>> brings a glass of chilled water with a single slice of cucumber floating in it, then waits nearby while you come back to yourself.
<br><br>
"This is not just a surface treatment," <<he>> explains. "The caviar extract and gold have been layered slowly, then sealed in with heat and pressure. With normal care, the effect should last for around one month."
<br><br>
<<He>> pauses, looking you over with professional approval. "You may notice the glow fading near the end of that period. That is expected. Until then, your skin should look rested, even when you are not."
<br><br>
When you sit up, you catch your reflection in the corridor mirror. The person looking back seems restored in a way sleep alone has never managed. There is a soft glow to your skin, expensive and difficult to ignore.<<lstress>><<ltiredness>><<stress -12>><<tiredness -10>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Return to the foyer|Spa]]>><<pass 60>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Diamond Arrive
<<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>
The receptionist does not lead you to the private wing. Instead, a <<person>> appears at your side. <<He>> introduces <<himself>> only as your programme coordinator.
<br><br>
<<He>> walks you past the private treatment rooms, through a door you had assumed was a cupboard, and down a short flight of stairs to a suite beneath the spa itself. The air is cooler, drier, and very still.
<br><br>
"The Diamond programme is where our private work begins," <<he>> says, setting a leather portfolio on the counter. "It uses the most advanced renewal technology we are permitted to offer outside a clinical setting."
<br><br>
<<He>> opens the portfolio. Inside are photographs of your face. They were taken, you realise, from the spa's entry camera. "We have already begun your first assessment. The treatment is designed to last up to a year. More importantly, it keeps settling after you leave. You may surprise yourself when you catch your reflection over the next few weeks."
<br><br>
A locked cabinet on the far wall bears a brass plate with your name on it. Inside, you can see rows of small bottles, each labelled in neat handwriting.
<br><br>
<<link [[Take a seat in the examination chair|Spa Beauty Diamond Treatment]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Diamond Treatment
<<effects>>
<<upperstrip>><<lowerstrip>><<legsstrip>><<feetstrip>><<handsstrip>><<handheldstrip>><<neckstrip>><<headstrip>>
The examination comes first. The coordinator measures your face with a thin metal tool, photographs you under three different lights, and writes numbers in a leather notebook. <<He>> does not explain what any of them mean.
<br><br>
Then the treatments begin, one after another without pause. Diamond dust, finer than sand, is brushed over your skin with bristles so soft you can barely feel them. Your skin stings faintly as it works, then goes numb, then warm. The coordinator wipes it away and nods at something only <<he>> can see.
<br><br>
The caviar mask is next, thicker and colder than the standard version. It sits on your face for twenty minutes while an attendant applies gold eye patches and massages serum into your scalp. The feeling is strange. Your face feels frozen in place while the rest of you melts into the chair.
<br><br>
Red-light therapy follows. You lie in a narrow capsule while warm light covers your skin. The coordinator explains that it helps collagen production; you barely hear <<him>> through the drowsy warmth.
<br><br>
The massage that ends the session is unlike any you have had. Your masseur works in silence, finding tension behind your ears, between your ribs, and in the small joints of your fingers.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Spa Beauty Diamond Finish]]>><<pass 150>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Diamond Finish
<<effects>>
<<run V.beautyBoost = V.beautyBoost || {}; V.beautyBoost.spa = { amount: 7000, expires: Time.days + 365, treatment: "diamond caviar renewal programme" }; delete V.beautyBoost._spaShown>>
The coordinator helps you stand. Your legs feel uncertain beneath you from the depth of relaxation. <<He>> steadies you with a hand on your elbow and guides you to a full-length mirror.
<br><br>
The difference is immediate and unsettling. Not because you look like a different person, but because you look like a better version of the same one. Your skin looks clearer, as if every tired mark has been sharpened away. The shadows beneath your eyes are gone. Even the way the light falls across your face seems brighter.
<br><br>
The coordinator then walks you back to the foyer in silence. The receptionist looks up as you pass, then looks again. For a second, even <<he>> forgets to be professional.<<lstress>><<ltiredness>><<ltrauma>><<stress -18>><<tiredness -16>><<trauma -6>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Return to the foyer|Spa]]>><<pass 70>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Manicure Arrive
<<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>
A <<person>> in a linen apron meets you in the private wing and leads you to a small parlour off the main corridor. The room smells faintly of orange-blossom oil and warm beeswax. A low chair sits beside a slim marble table; the surface holds a row of small ceramic dishes, a soft towel rolled to one side, and a tray of buffers and clippers arranged.
<br><br>
"Please make yourself comfortable," <<he>> says, gesturing to the chair. "Warm water and salts first, then we shape and finish."
<br><br>
You settle in. <<He>> wheels over a small copper basin of steaming water and sets it before you, then dips both your hands into it. The heat works its way up your wrists.
<br><br>
<<link [[Let the warm soak do its work|Spa Beauty Manicure Treatment]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Manicure Treatment
<<effects>><<handsstrip>><<handheldstrip>>
The <<person>> lifts your hands from the water one at a time, pats them dry, and begins. <<He>> works methodically with pushing back cuticles, easing the rough skin from around each nail, then shaping every tip with a fine glass file.
<br><br>
When the shape is right, <<he>> reaches for the buffer. The white edges of your nails brighten; the surface of each nail takes on a clean, smooth sheen. <<He>> finishes with a thin layer of clear lacquer that catches the light without colouring it. The effect is subtle. You wouldn't notice it on a stranger. You will notice it on yourself.
<br><br>
"A glass of water?" <<he>> asks, already pouring one. While the lacquer sets, <<he>> works a drop of warm oil into the skin of your knuckles and the backs of your hands. The oil smells faintly of almond.
<br><br>
<<link [[Examine the finished work|Spa Beauty Manicure Finish]]>><<pass 25>><</link>>

:: Spa Beauty Manicure Finish
<<effects>>
<<run V.beautyBoost = V.beautyBoost || {}; V.beautyBoost.nails = { amount: 2800, expires: Time.days + 30, treatment: "signature manicure" }; delete V.beautyBoost._nailsShown>>
/* The manicure shapes the nails to a clean, even neat length and resets the growth clock. 
$nailsgrowth = 3 puts the player at the bottom of level 1, so they enjoy ~4 days of "neat" before drifting into "long", long enough to actually feel the manicure aesthetic while it matches their nail state. */
<<set $nailsgrowth to 3>><<set $nailslevel to 1>>
The <<person>> holds your hands palm-down on the towel and lets you look. The shape across all ten nails is perfectly even. The cuticles are clean. The surface of each nail catches the light like polished horn. Even the skin around them looks softer than it did half an hour ago.
<br><br>
"This will hold its appearance for about a month, with normal care," <<he>> says. "If you would like to return for a refresh, the receptionist can book you."
<br><br>
You flex your fingers. Even small movements feel a little different.<<lstress>><<stress -4>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Return to the foyer|Spa]]>><<pass 10>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Spa Private Masseur
<<endevent>><<effects>><<generatey1>><<person1>>
A private masseur arrives within minutes, carrying a folded table and a leather case of oils. <<He>> asks what pressure you prefer, checks before touching, and keeps the door unlatched until you tell <<him>> you are comfortable.
<br><br>
The massage is professional, warm, and thorough. Knots loosen beneath <<his>> hands. By the end, your limbs feel heavy and your thoughts pleasantly slow.
<br><br>
You feel relaxed and looked after.<<lstress>><<ltiredness>><<lpain>><<stress -10>><<tiredness -8>><<pain -4>>
<br><br>
<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(500)>>
	<<link [[Leave a gratuity|Spa Private Masseur Gratuity]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if $money >= (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(375000) : 375000)>>
	<<link [[Proposition the masseur privately|Spa Private Masseur Offer]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Return to the foyer|Spa]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

