:: Spa Private Masseur Gratuity Give
<<effects>><<person1>>
<<if $phase is 0>>
	You leave the <<person>> <<printprice 500>>. <<He>> smiles and thanks you for thinking of <<him>>.
<<elseif $phase is 1>>
	You leave the <<person>> <<printprice 2500>>. "Thank you," <<he>> says, smiling warmly.
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	You leave the <<person>> <<printprice 10000>>. <<He>> blinks at the money, then gives you a grateful smile. "That is very kind of you."
<<elseif $phase is 3>>
	You leave the <<person>> <<printprice 20000>>. <<His>> professional composure slips into open surprise. "Are you sure? Thank you."
<<elseif $phase is 4>>
	You leave the <<person>> <<printprice 50000>>. <<He>> stares for a moment before carefully accepting it. "Thank you. This means more than you know."
<<else>>
	You leave the <<person>> <<printprice 100000>>. <<He>> looks from the money to you, stunned. "I do not know what to say. Thank you. Truly."
<</if>>
<br><br>
The <<person>> finishes packing <<his>> oils and leaves with a grateful farewell.
<br><br>
<<link [[Return to the foyer|Spa]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Spa Private Masseur Offer
<<effects>><<person1>>
You let the quiet stretch for a moment after the massage ends. The <<person>> begins packing away <<his>> oils, careful not to look as though <<he>> is lingering.
<br><br>
"You did well," you say. "Very well."
<br><br>
<<He>> stills, one bottle half-slotted into the leather case.
<br><br>
"I could show my gratitude," you continue. "Privately. If you think you can satisfy me."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Spa Private Masseur Offer 2]]>><</link>>

:: Spa Private Masseur Offer 2
<<effects>><<switch random(1, 3)>>
<<case 1>>
	For a heartbeat, <<he>> only stares. Then <<his>> expression changes, eagerness breaking through the professional calm before <<he>> can hide it.
	"I can!" <<He>> coughs, then lowers <<his>> voice. "I mean, if that is what you want."
	<br><br>
	You smile. "Seems we had the same thing in mind."
<<case 2>>
	"That is not usually part of the service," <<he>> says, though <<his>> eyes glance at the money you lay beside the folded sheet.
	<br><br>
	"I know you need this," you say softly. "And I know you can help me."
	<br><br>
	"What? Oh, wait. Y-You are..." <<He>> swallows, then gives a small nod. "Okay."
<<case 3>>
	<<He>> hesitates, hands hovering over the leather case. The offer is clear enough. The money is clearer.
	<br><br>
	"You can turn this down," you say.
	<br><br>
	That seems to undo the last of <<his>> restraint. <<He>> steps forward too quickly. "I need the money! And I can make it worth your money."
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<if $money >= (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(375000) : 375000)>>
	<<link [[Accept the arrangement|Spa Private Masseur Intimate]]>><<money -375000 "spa">><<pass 60>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
