:: Spa Members Party
<<effects>>
<<if $spaBeautyMember isnot 1>>
	A guard steps in front of the frosted door. "Members only."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Back|Spa]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<endevent>><<generate1>><<person1>>
	The members' party fills the private lounge and the garden courtyard beyond it. It has the loose, warm feel of a resort party, only cleaner, richer, and much harder to enter. Lanterns hang from potted palms. The pool is black tile, with frangipani flowers floating on the surface.
	<br><br>
	The guests wear linen shirts, silk dresses, loose trousers, and jewellery that looks plain until you notice the cost. The bar smells of lime, ginger, and expensive alcohol. Everyone sounds relaxed, but no one stops watching each other.
	<br><br>
	A <<person>> looks you over with open interest. "You're unusual to be in a room like this. That makes you either lucky, dangerous, or very good with money. Maybe all three."
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<if random(1, 100) lte 35 and $xchange and $xchange.bankHeist and $xchange.bankHeist.heistComplete and !$daily.spaXChangeGossip>>
