<br><br>
The guard moves faster than expected. <<He>> catches your shoulder and turns you from the frosted door with a grip meant to bruise. "Out!"
<br><br>
You shove back. The receptionist lets out a sharp, panicked sound and reaches beneath the desk.
<br><br>
