<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	The guard staggers back hard enough to hit the wall. But another guard appears at the far end, speaking rapidly into a radio.
	<br><br>
	You decide the suites are not worth being pinned between them. You leave before the second guard reaches you.
	<br><br>
