<<else>>
	The guard forces you back through the foyer while the receptionist keeps repeating that the police do not need to be called if you simply leave. The patrons pretend not to watch.
	<br><br>
	"<span class="red">You're banned</span>," the guard barks, shoving the door open. "<<print $spaBanWeeks>> week<<print $spaBanWeeks is 1 ? "" : "s">>. Try again before then and we call the police."
<</if>>
